# Normalize text files to LF in both the repository and the working tree.
# 文本文件在仓库与工作区统一为 LF 行尾。
# Keeps Prettier (endOfLine: lf) and ESLint stable on Windows checkouts.
# 保证 Prettier 与 ESLint 在 Windows 检出下行为稳定。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-specific scripts must keep CRLF / Windows 专用脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary files — never touch line endings / 二进制文件 —— 不做行尾处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
